"P200501809" "Drea the Hook"
// DescriptionString :
"P4068575212" "Drea the Hook made his living as a crab fisherman, until his boat, and everyone else on it, went down in the icy waters off the coast of Alaska. Since that day, Drea can't seem to shake his fear of the sea. He doesn't have much compunction about the deals he brokers for villains in Port Oakes, though he knows that innocents often pay the price. Drea's just looking to put away a chunk of change that'll buy him a cozy retirement in a nice, landlocked community. His dedication to that dream makes him a reliable source of information."
// HelloString :
"P1450863435" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You might be interested in this.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P950408422" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I got something you can do.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2677256950" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You want work? You came to the right place.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3669834244" "We got nothing to say to one another. Maybe you want {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1174684012" "My name's Drea. That's all you need to know. The less we know about each other, the better for both of us, dig?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2805699316" "I got nothing more for you. You want to check with someone else."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2965176134" "You're too busy to handle my jobs."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P131358324" "I got something, but it's big. Too big for anyone below Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P563578005" "Well, well, {VillainName}. I think this may be the beginning of a beautiful friendship."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P324943364" "You're doing good, {VillainName}. Keep it up, and I'll stand by you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2583315641" "I got nothing more that would interest you, {VillainName}. Now get outta here."
// IntroString :
"P3720490652" "I'd like you to meet someone named Drea the Hook. He can get you intel on everybody in Port Oakes."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1906228434" "Choose Drea the Hook"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P4106116722" "Drea's a tough cookie, but if you earn his respect, he'll take you far."
